The loop below asks every name in the list the same question,
[[get_paper_by_doi]], and merges the answer.
Crossref's and Europe PMC's clients answer it too
(\cref{sec:crossref-abstract,europepmc-module}), but they are not in
the provider registry: they are not search providers, and registering
them would put them in [[scholar providers list]], [[providers check]]
and every default search.
So [[enrichment_source]] resolves a name: the shared client of an
abstract service, else the registered provider.
The services' modules are imported here; [[scholar.crossref]] is
loaded by the preprint fallback already.

<<constants>>=
# Per-DOI services that fill fields the search providers left empty,
